  "post_content": "<p>Este primer s&aacute;bado de abril se ha celebrado la romer&iacute;a de Devotos de Fanzara al ermitorio del Salvador, en Onda, que por un d&iacute;a cambia virutalmente de t&eacute;rmino municipal.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/04/IMG_0380.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>En la Cueva Santa, las personas asistentes&nbsp;han recogido el rollo ofrecido por el Ayuntamiento de Fanzara.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriadevotosfanzaraelsalvador17/img_0318.jpg\" alt=\"img_0318\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriadevotosfanzaraelsalvador17/img_0319.jpg\" alt=\"img_0319\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriadevotosfanzaraelsalvador17/img_0321.jpg\" alt=\"img_0321\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriadevotosfanzaraelsalvador17/img_0322.jpg\" alt=\"img_0322\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriadevotosfanzaraelsalvador17/img_0324.jpg\" alt=\"img_0324\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriadevotosfanzaraelsalvador17/img_0327.jpg\" alt=\"img_0327\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriadevotosfanzaraelsalvador17/img_0328.jpg\" alt=\"img_0328\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriadevotosfanzaraelsalvador17/img_0329.jpg\" alt=\"img_0329\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/romeriadevoto